WEBVTT

01:40.800 --> 01:41.960
TRAVEL PERMIT

01:43.400 --> 01:45.720
Meiniang, you won't be transporting goods

01:46.320 --> 01:48.000
but people.

01:48.080 --> 01:50.720
Otherwise, why would you need
two Travel Permits?

01:52.280 --> 01:53.520
In the black market,

01:53.600 --> 01:56.840
you can only ask about the goods,
not the people. Well?

01:59.720 --> 02:00.880
I'm just curious.

02:01.680 --> 02:04.080
TRAVEL PERMIT

02:15.440 --> 02:17.480
IMPERIAL PRISON

02:21.200 --> 02:22.040
It's him.

02:31.800 --> 02:33.160
Why did he ask for the Travel Permits?

02:33.240 --> 02:34.080
I…

02:34.160 --> 02:36.560
I only know that Meiniang has channels
for illicit trade with Xiyan.

02:36.640 --> 02:37.960
I know nothing else.

02:49.760 --> 02:51.520
My lord, something's up
at the Court of State Ceremonial.

03:09.120 --> 03:10.240
Who are you?

03:11.040 --> 03:12.560
Why did you infiltrate
the peace-making marriage delegation?

03:12.640 --> 03:14.120
To kill Murong Jinghe.

03:14.200 --> 03:15.120
Why?

03:15.200 --> 03:16.600
To avenge Qingzhou.

03:24.720 --> 03:25.560
General Yin,

03:26.080 --> 03:27.760
I'm Yue Qin, the supervisor
at the Court of State Ceremonial.

03:27.840 --> 03:29.360
If you need to investigate a case,
I can assist you.

03:31.040 --> 03:32.640
I've finished the investigation.

03:40.400 --> 03:41.920
Mei Lin, are you hurt?

03:43.880 --> 03:46.200
Sir, who is she?

03:46.280 --> 03:47.720
The commander of Pingnan Army,

03:47.800 --> 03:48.640
Yin Luomei.

03:50.520 --> 03:53.080
We've dealt with Mingju scouts
so many times.

03:53.800 --> 03:56.600
Her martial arts skills
don't seem like those of a Xiyan scout.

03:57.560 --> 03:59.160
Have you checked all her records
from the Imperial Prison?

03:59.760 --> 04:01.040
I've checked them all.

04:01.120 --> 04:02.480
She is just an orphan of Qingzhou.

04:02.560 --> 04:03.560
There's nothing amiss.

04:04.360 --> 04:06.280
With her martial arts skills,
she is no ordinary Beauty.

04:06.880 --> 04:08.720
- Continue to investigate her.
- Yes.

04:10.920 --> 04:13.560
No wonder there is no news
from the Eastern Palace recently.

04:14.280 --> 04:17.360
It turns out they want to use Luomei
to deal with me.

04:18.720 --> 04:20.079
Will you inform General Yin?

04:20.600 --> 04:21.720
Not necessary.

04:22.360 --> 04:24.120
Mei Lin's identity
has been made very clean.

04:24.760 --> 04:26.360
She won't find any problem.

04:27.000 --> 04:30.520
Making an extra move
will only increase suspicion.

04:31.080 --> 04:34.080
The urgent task now
is to capture Zhang Yin.

04:34.840 --> 04:38.360
My lord, I don't quite understand.
Why did you have to let Shumo go?

04:38.440 --> 04:40.840
Are you afraid this has something
to do with Mr. Yue Qin?

04:41.440 --> 04:43.640
Yue Qin and my father are friends
despite the difference in age.

04:43.720 --> 04:44.960
He doesn't have to do that.

04:45.600 --> 04:47.880
We don't have to disturb
the Xiyan Hostage Prince.

04:47.960 --> 04:49.840
As long as we follow Shumo closely,

04:49.920 --> 04:52.440
we can track down Zhang Yin.

04:53.040 --> 04:53.880
Understood.

04:54.440 --> 04:56.960
Shall we tell Miss Mei Lin
about Shumo's identity?

04:59.040 --> 05:01.160
Yue Qin has done a favor for Mei Lin.

05:01.240 --> 05:03.120
Good people always think
about repaying kindness,

05:03.680 --> 05:05.160
which can lead to mistakes.

05:08.560 --> 05:11.480
Currently, the Court of State Ceremonial
is filled with the Crown Prince's men.

05:11.560 --> 05:14.360
Once our men start to take action,
it will arouse suspicion.

05:15.120 --> 05:17.080
Once the Eastern Palace discovers Shumo,

05:17.160 --> 05:19.320
Zhang Yin's whereabouts will
definitely not remain a secret for long.

05:23.000 --> 05:26.680
I will move in openly then.

05:32.520 --> 05:34.120
Fortunately, the embroidered screen
wasn't damaged.

05:34.720 --> 05:36.880
However, what case
is General Yin investigating?

05:37.480 --> 05:38.760
About the assassination attempt
at Prince Jing.

05:41.600 --> 05:44.920
General Yin and Prince Jing
are childhood friends.

05:45.520 --> 05:48.040
I supposed she's worried that you will
try to hurt Prince Jing again.

05:48.120 --> 05:49.400
It's to warn you.

05:53.400 --> 05:55.200
The embroidered screen is the same
as the original one.

05:55.720 --> 05:57.800
I guess you're free to leave now,
Miss Mei Lin.

05:57.880 --> 05:59.200
Not yet.

06:00.120 --> 06:02.280
Prince Jing says it still lacks charm.

06:02.360 --> 06:04.040
I have to go on repairing it.

06:05.560 --> 06:07.840
Miss, have you thought about it?

06:07.920 --> 06:10.200
Whether this embroidered screen
is considered repaired

06:10.280 --> 06:12.000
lies solely in Prince Jing's discretion.

06:12.600 --> 06:14.160
If he wants
to make things difficult for you,

06:14.240 --> 06:15.600
you may never finish repairing it.

06:17.280 --> 06:19.160
Sir, actually, I--

06:19.240 --> 06:20.200
Brother. Mei Lin.

06:21.440 --> 06:23.760
- Zigu, how did you--?
- Brother, don't worry.

06:23.840 --> 06:25.360
My coming here was approved
by His Majesty.

06:27.440 --> 06:29.960
Mei Lin, I heard
you were under house arrest.

06:30.040 --> 06:31.760
Did Prince Jing bully you again?

06:32.360 --> 06:33.400
Your Highness,

06:33.480 --> 06:34.320
Sir,

06:34.400 --> 06:36.320
you don't have to worry.

06:36.400 --> 06:38.880
Actually, the grudge
between Prince Jing and me

06:38.960 --> 06:40.240
was settled long ago,

06:40.320 --> 06:41.880
and it was even decreed
in the imperial edict.

06:41.960 --> 06:43.360
Don't worry about me.

06:44.920 --> 06:45.920
Okay.

06:50.800 --> 06:52.920
Brother, what should we do later?

07:12.720 --> 07:14.360
Mei Lin,

07:14.440 --> 07:16.680
after your house arrest is lifted,

07:16.760 --> 07:19.320
shall I take you to Mingcui Tower
for a drink?

07:19.880 --> 07:21.840
I've heard the liquor
in Great Yan is very strong.

07:23.040 --> 07:23.880
Okay.

07:26.280 --> 07:27.640
Forget it.

07:28.680 --> 07:30.680
We are the same.

07:30.760 --> 07:32.560
You are under house arrest.

07:33.480 --> 07:36.560
After my brother leaves, I won't
be able to leave the palace at will.

07:40.880 --> 07:43.440
Shumo, I want some more.

07:45.120 --> 07:47.560
Let her drink. She feels awful.

07:54.760 --> 07:56.240
Brother.

07:57.640 --> 07:58.680
Be careful.

07:58.760 --> 08:00.840
You're the best.

08:01.560 --> 08:04.400
But when my brother gets angry,
he looks terrifying.

08:05.040 --> 08:08.080
When I was a child, I once misbehaved
and startled a horse.

08:08.160 --> 08:11.880
In order to save me,
my brother broke a finger.

08:11.960 --> 08:14.560
My mother punished me.
I didn't take it lying down.

08:14.640 --> 08:17.400
I said I could
give a finger of mine to my brother.

08:18.000 --> 08:19.440
Guess what my brother said.

08:20.840 --> 08:22.040
What did he say?

08:24.440 --> 08:25.440
My brother said,

08:25.520 --> 08:28.520
"No one can hurt my sister's finger,
not even you."

08:31.440 --> 08:34.919
Mei Lin, isn't my brother wonderful?

08:35.679 --> 08:39.559
To be family with my brother
is the happiest thing in the world.

08:39.640 --> 08:42.480
You once saved my brother, and I like you.

08:42.559 --> 08:44.080
Can you join our family?

08:50.680 --> 08:53.320
Thank you, Your Highness, Sir.

08:55.960 --> 08:59.080
I'm very lucky to have met you.

09:00.160 --> 09:01.400
Mei Lin has agreed.

09:02.480 --> 09:03.320
Sir,

09:04.720 --> 09:06.080
someone from the palace has come
to pick Her Highness up.

09:07.840 --> 09:08.800
I can't hear you.

09:08.880 --> 09:10.160
I won't go back.

09:13.280 --> 09:15.200
Your Highness, the palace gate
is about to be closed.

09:15.280 --> 09:17.640
If you go back late,
the Noble Consort will punish you.

09:18.400 --> 09:19.640
I'll be punished anyway.

09:19.720 --> 09:21.200
I'll go back tomorrow.

09:21.840 --> 09:24.000
If you are grounded
and can't leave the palace,

09:24.080 --> 09:25.880
how will you drink with Mei Lin again?

09:27.360 --> 09:30.600
Right. Your Highness,
let's drink together.

09:32.880 --> 09:34.080
Fine.

09:34.880 --> 09:37.120
Mei Lin, promise me.

09:37.200 --> 09:39.520
Ask my brother whenever you need help.
He'll help you.

09:41.560 --> 09:45.920
I know you two are good people.

09:48.560 --> 09:49.880
Take it slow.

09:51.600 --> 09:53.640
You mean,

09:53.720 --> 09:57.120
Mei Lin still doesn't know
your feelings for her?

09:58.600 --> 10:00.360
Why didn't you tell her?

10:00.440 --> 10:02.800
You two won't be together
until you confess your feelings to her.

10:05.440 --> 10:06.280
Zigu,

10:08.400 --> 10:10.840
a relationship requires mutual affection.

10:12.240 --> 10:14.080
Mei Lin isn't in the mood
for a relationship right now.

10:14.160 --> 10:15.960
If I confess my feelings rashly,

10:16.480 --> 10:18.000
it will put her in a difficult position.

10:18.080 --> 10:19.400
Now

10:20.760 --> 10:22.400
is not a good time to confess.

10:24.840 --> 10:28.280
You always have your reasons.

10:29.280 --> 10:31.120
But if you don't tell her now,

10:31.200 --> 10:34.080
you might have no chance
to tell her in the future.

10:53.320 --> 10:55.920
TRAVEL PERMIT

11:08.120 --> 11:09.840
If I can send away Zhang Yin successfully,

11:11.000 --> 11:12.440
I can use this channel

11:12.520 --> 11:14.320
to help Mr. Yue Qin
to send Miss Mei Lin away.

11:21.920 --> 11:22.760
Sir.

11:30.360 --> 11:32.720
Are you injured?

11:33.840 --> 11:35.360
It's a minor injury. It's nothing.

11:36.160 --> 11:37.360
I've already applied the medicine.

11:40.040 --> 11:41.080
What's wrong?

11:42.480 --> 11:44.640
Why do you seem
to have a lot on your mind?

11:46.680 --> 11:48.160
Now, besides Prince Jing,

11:49.160 --> 11:50.960
even General Yin is watching Mei Lin.

11:52.840 --> 11:54.320
Mei Lin must be trying to take revenge.

11:55.160 --> 11:57.040
But staying in Zhaojing
is fraught with danger.

11:57.640 --> 11:59.360
I just want her to survive.

11:59.960 --> 12:00.800
Sir,

12:01.480 --> 12:04.240
actually, we can use the channels
of black market smugglers

12:04.320 --> 12:05.440
to send Miss Mei Lin away.

12:06.240 --> 12:08.520
This way, not only
won't you be implicated,

12:09.120 --> 12:10.720
but Prince Jing will also
have no way to investigate.

12:14.320 --> 12:17.400
This is the Travel Permit
from the black market to Xiyan.

12:18.720 --> 12:20.080
Smuggling in the black market?

12:21.480 --> 12:23.880
How did you know about
the smugglers in the black market?

12:27.640 --> 12:30.520
Those in the black market
are all about money.

12:31.400 --> 12:32.960
As long as you pay, they'll do the job.

12:33.920 --> 12:34.920
Rest assured, Sir.

12:35.520 --> 12:38.000
Anyway, I will receive word
from that person

12:38.680 --> 12:40.160
after the Shangsi Festival.

12:44.720 --> 12:50.880
COURT OF STATE CEREMONIAL

12:51.840 --> 12:52.960
What do you need, my lord?

12:53.560 --> 12:55.480
I'm concerned about the Beauty

12:56.800 --> 12:58.440
and the embroidered screen.

12:58.520 --> 13:01.640
I'm here to supervise the repair work
and speed it up.

13:02.240 --> 13:04.400
My lord, there are no spare rooms here.

13:04.480 --> 13:06.680
I'm afraid you can't stay here.

13:06.760 --> 13:08.920
These are my personal bedding items.

13:09.000 --> 13:11.000
You don't have to prepare them for me.

13:11.080 --> 13:14.560
As for the rooms, don't worry about that.

13:14.640 --> 13:15.480
The Beauty…

13:17.000 --> 13:19.880
I'll be wherever
the embroidered screen is.

13:20.840 --> 13:22.320
The distribution is around the corner.

13:22.400 --> 13:24.520
Can't you wait just a few days?

13:24.600 --> 13:27.680
I can, but I don't want to.

13:31.360 --> 13:34.000
Mei Lin damaged
Empress Dejia's embroidered screen.

13:34.600 --> 13:37.960
The magnitude of this offense lies

13:38.040 --> 13:40.640
in my discretion.

13:41.280 --> 13:42.880
Since you want to be the good guy,

13:43.600 --> 13:44.960
you might as well help
with the whole thing.

13:53.520 --> 13:54.480
Oh, right.

13:55.680 --> 13:57.360
The Beauty is shy at night.

13:57.440 --> 13:58.760
Outside the embroidery room,

13:58.840 --> 14:00.800
there should only be people
from my mansion.

14:01.560 --> 14:02.400
Thank you.

14:27.440 --> 14:30.840
The Imperial Guard
originally patrolled every hour.

14:32.560 --> 14:34.520
But since you came,
they haven't left their posts.

14:38.680 --> 14:39.840
Did you move
to the Court of State Ceremonial

14:39.920 --> 14:42.240
because you made new progress
in finding the man?

14:47.720 --> 14:51.040
The Meiniang you saw in Wenhua Pavilion
is indeed a man.

14:51.720 --> 14:54.480
By following him,
we can find where Zhang Yin is.

14:55.080 --> 14:56.840
Now, the Court of State Ceremonial
is full of spies.

14:57.640 --> 15:00.400
You must cooperate with me
to divert attention

15:00.480 --> 15:02.240
so that Qingyan can continue the pursuit.

15:02.320 --> 15:03.640
Understood.

15:05.040 --> 15:05.880
My lord,

15:06.600 --> 15:08.280
General Yin came to me today.

15:08.880 --> 15:10.360
I know

15:11.000 --> 15:13.360
someone wants to use you against me.

15:13.440 --> 15:15.600
This is just a common tactic of intrigue

15:15.680 --> 15:17.240
used in the court.

15:17.320 --> 15:18.520
You don't need to know this.

15:19.160 --> 15:20.320
Now you

15:20.400 --> 15:23.200
only have to cooperate with me
to put on a good show.

15:37.200 --> 15:38.760
No women dare to take the initiative

15:38.840 --> 15:40.920
to sleep in my bed.

15:47.560 --> 15:48.960
Don't overthink it.

15:49.560 --> 15:50.520
I won't do anything to you.

15:50.600 --> 15:52.800
I should say that to you.

15:53.560 --> 15:55.160
But you can't defeat me.

15:59.760 --> 16:02.440
Do you think you call the shots
with your superb martial arts skills?

16:04.720 --> 16:06.720
Go to bed, my lord.

16:25.480 --> 16:26.680
Get up.

16:33.720 --> 16:35.200
I'll take the inside.

16:35.720 --> 16:38.240
When I'm sleeping,
I won't show my back to anyone.

16:53.480 --> 16:54.640
Leaving the lights on while sleeping

16:57.000 --> 16:58.560
is also one of my rules.

17:13.520 --> 17:15.359
You are lying on my robe.

17:40.840 --> 17:42.200
You can't fall asleep, can you?

17:42.800 --> 17:44.760
With a killer beside me,

17:44.840 --> 17:46.640
I certainly can't fall asleep.

17:51.440 --> 17:52.920
You've said

17:53.000 --> 17:54.160
I'm just an ordinary Beauty now,

17:55.480 --> 17:57.880
whom you can kill at any time.

18:53.120 --> 18:54.280
It's just the wind.

19:01.480 --> 19:02.840
I have a way to make you fall asleep.

19:03.840 --> 19:04.680
What is it?

19:07.400 --> 19:09.000
First, apply pressure
to the shoulders and neck

19:09.560 --> 19:10.480
to numb the meridians.

19:11.520 --> 19:13.520
Then guide the force to the Fengchi point.

19:13.600 --> 19:15.080
With a precise application of strength
to the wrist…

19:23.200 --> 19:24.920
So many people want to kill you.

19:25.880 --> 19:27.440
How can you sleep soundly?

19:29.800 --> 19:30.640
Just sleep.

19:31.760 --> 19:32.600
I'll guard you.

20:53.360 --> 20:56.320
Minister Zhang, the Travel Permit
is ready.

20:56.400 --> 20:58.160
Meet you at the old place
on the Shangsi Festival.

21:24.560 --> 21:27.240
How dare you knock me out?

21:27.840 --> 21:29.160
You even took off my outer robe.

21:30.160 --> 21:31.640
Did you sleep well last night?

21:31.720 --> 21:32.800
No.

21:33.920 --> 21:35.240
But you snored.

21:41.520 --> 21:42.360
Help me put it on.

22:06.080 --> 22:08.160
My lord, please have breakfast.

22:30.480 --> 22:32.040
This crispy cake is sour and astringent.

22:36.080 --> 22:37.280
You love this?

22:39.320 --> 22:41.040
How can you eat such a distasteful thing?

22:41.720 --> 22:43.160
I can't taste anything.

22:44.400 --> 22:47.240
The day after the fire in Qingzhou,
I lost my sense of taste.

22:57.080 --> 22:57.920
Mother,

22:59.560 --> 23:00.640
where are you?

23:12.800 --> 23:15.120
Mother, where are you?

23:30.600 --> 23:31.440
Mother.

23:40.080 --> 23:41.680
On the day the Weibei Army
entered the city,

23:43.040 --> 23:44.880
I urged my mother to make cakes for me.

23:46.880 --> 23:48.680
My mother said she'd make ten cakes

23:48.760 --> 23:51.400
to make up for all the missed birthdays.

23:53.480 --> 23:54.800
That night,

23:55.960 --> 23:57.560
my mother kept making cakes.

24:12.560 --> 24:13.880
From then on,

24:14.600 --> 24:15.920
I couldn't taste anything.

24:17.040 --> 24:18.080
Did you get treated?

24:20.760 --> 24:21.800
That's not necessary.

24:23.120 --> 24:25.200
The taste of food is not important.

24:25.280 --> 24:26.480
Filling the stomach matters the most.

24:32.600 --> 24:33.440
My lord.

24:39.640 --> 24:41.840
Zhang Yin and Shumo arranged
to meet on the Shangsi Festival.

24:45.440 --> 24:47.760
On the Shangsi Festival, you can go out.

24:49.880 --> 24:50.960
Is there any news about Zhang Yin?

24:51.040 --> 24:52.840
Zhang Yin will show up
on the Shangsi Festival.

24:52.920 --> 24:54.680
At that time, we can catch him directly.

24:58.920 --> 25:01.440
The Shangsi Festival
will be an opportunity for us.

25:02.360 --> 25:05.000
Get a few unfamiliar faces
to keep a close watch on Shumo.

25:05.600 --> 25:07.760
Mei Lin and I will help you draw
attention away from the others.

25:08.360 --> 25:11.240
If Zhang Yin dares to show up,
we will catch him immediately.

25:11.320 --> 25:12.240
Yes.

25:12.320 --> 25:16.360
Besides, get a few men to keep a close
watch on Concubine Yan in the palace.

25:17.040 --> 25:18.800
She is Yue Qin's vulnerability.

25:19.440 --> 25:21.120
Should the plan change,

25:21.200 --> 25:23.600
we can use her to control
both him and his servant.

25:24.520 --> 25:26.640
- Okay.
- Oh, right.

25:27.440 --> 25:28.720
Get a wandering healer

25:28.800 --> 25:30.800
to concoct a remedy for the loss of taste.

25:32.280 --> 25:33.400
Have you lost your sense of taste?

25:37.280 --> 25:39.160
When you get the remedy, send it to her.

25:40.440 --> 25:42.040
Well, to whom?

25:42.120 --> 25:44.120
Hey, who should I send it to?

25:44.200 --> 25:45.240
To whom?

25:45.960 --> 25:49.000
FENGYI PALACE

25:49.600 --> 25:50.720
Your Highness,

25:50.800 --> 25:53.800
you've been watching me
practice for four hours.

25:54.400 --> 25:56.880
How about you take a break?

25:59.040 --> 26:00.960
I am appointed by His Majesty
to instruct you.

26:01.040 --> 26:04.120
If you still can't remember
all the rules in the palace,

26:04.200 --> 26:05.880
I dare not take a break.

26:05.960 --> 26:07.760
I've remembered them.

26:11.600 --> 26:12.440
Your Highness,

26:13.200 --> 26:17.640
I've heard the Shangsi Festival is a grand
celebration of spring of the Yan Dynasty.

26:17.720 --> 26:20.040
Everyone in the palace and commoners
are busy with rituals and prayers.

26:20.720 --> 26:21.560
Your Highness,

26:21.640 --> 26:23.760
you should hurry and attend
to your important matters.

26:24.480 --> 26:26.880
Don't let my affairs delay your prayers.

26:28.600 --> 26:29.600
You want to slip out of the palace?

26:30.320 --> 26:31.520
No.

26:36.400 --> 26:39.360
Imperial concubines can only leave
the palace under my permission.

26:40.600 --> 26:41.480
Keep it in mind.

26:42.680 --> 26:44.040
Yes.

26:45.640 --> 26:48.360
Your Highness, can I leave the palace?

26:48.440 --> 26:49.360
No.

26:50.040 --> 26:51.840
The Shangsi Festival
is both a spring celebration

26:51.920 --> 26:53.800
and a day for romantic enjoyment.

26:53.880 --> 26:55.360
As a royal concubine,

26:55.440 --> 26:56.480
what are you joining in the fun for?

26:57.320 --> 26:58.160
Continue to practice.

27:01.120 --> 27:03.160
Your Highness. Your Highness.

27:03.240 --> 27:06.000
Your Highness, I need to use the restroom.

27:11.120 --> 27:12.240
Go ahead.

27:21.880 --> 27:24.280
Please go back, Your Highness.

27:24.360 --> 27:27.000
If it takes too long,
the Noble Consort will punish you.

27:28.320 --> 27:29.320
Let me rest a while longer.

27:29.840 --> 27:32.240
Chagu, my leg really hurts.

27:32.320 --> 27:33.760
Rub it a little more.

27:39.920 --> 27:41.320
It's Concubine Yan.

27:44.000 --> 27:45.280
Chagu,

27:45.360 --> 27:47.240
when we go back, just say

27:47.320 --> 27:49.520
I ate something bad and had loose bowels.

27:50.120 --> 27:51.800
You've used this excuse before.

27:55.120 --> 27:57.160
Why are there so many rules in Great Yan?

27:57.760 --> 27:59.200
They are more annoying
than the mosquitoes in Xiyan.

27:59.840 --> 28:02.440
Does the Noble Consort spend all day
doing nothing

28:02.520 --> 28:04.160
but watching me?

28:05.760 --> 28:08.480
I've heard that the Noble Consort
is most concerned

28:08.560 --> 28:10.040
about the marriage of her niece,
General Yin.

28:10.120 --> 28:12.480
Right. The No. 1 female general
in Great Yan.

28:15.160 --> 28:17.360
Forget it. I can't beat her.

28:18.120 --> 28:20.680
Your Highness, what do you want to do?

28:21.280 --> 28:22.440
What can I do?

28:23.120 --> 28:25.960
I just want the Noble Consort
to keep her eyes off me.

28:26.760 --> 28:27.800
Could you ask Mr. Yue Qin

28:27.880 --> 28:31.080
to plead with Her Highness?

28:31.160 --> 28:32.000
No.

28:32.760 --> 28:34.280
I can't bring trouble to my brother.

28:35.120 --> 28:37.520
How about pleading with His Majesty?

28:38.160 --> 28:40.760
I think His Majesty is nice
to Your Highness.

28:44.320 --> 28:45.160
No.

28:46.080 --> 28:49.120
I think His Majesty is unfathomable.

28:49.880 --> 28:52.800
Maybe he is more terrible
than a black bear when he gets angry.

28:53.760 --> 28:55.520
I'd rather go back

28:55.600 --> 28:57.400
and stand in punishment
than plead with him.

29:12.840 --> 29:14.400
FENGYI PALACE

29:14.480 --> 29:16.080
Greetings, Your Highness.

29:17.000 --> 29:19.320
You still remember that I'm in the palace.

29:19.400 --> 29:21.720
I received my orders
right after I returned,

29:21.800 --> 29:23.120
so I really couldn't get away.

29:23.200 --> 29:25.120
Don't use His Majesty
as an excuse with me.

29:27.200 --> 29:28.720
Now that you've returned to the capital,

29:28.800 --> 29:30.960
an arranged marriage for you
is inevitable.

29:31.760 --> 29:33.080
You know it, Aunt.

29:33.160 --> 29:34.880
My life's ambition is in the army.

29:35.800 --> 29:38.360
Don't tell me you would
marry Great Yan again.

29:38.440 --> 29:40.840
It's a pity you're a girl.

29:41.400 --> 29:44.280
I was against it when my elder brother
had you join the army.

29:44.800 --> 29:46.080
Fortunately, over these years,

29:46.160 --> 29:47.200
you've earned quite a bit
of military merit

29:48.280 --> 29:50.680
and gained the rights to choose.

29:51.680 --> 29:53.280
His Majesty's intention

29:53.360 --> 29:55.680
is for you to choose one
from among the adult princes.

29:57.040 --> 29:59.760
Whether or not the military token
of the Pingnan Army

30:00.360 --> 30:02.280
can be passed down depends
entirely on His Majesty's decision.

30:04.160 --> 30:05.320
The women of the Yin family

30:06.160 --> 30:08.120
ultimately must marry
into the royal family.

30:09.240 --> 30:12.000
I can see the Crown Prince is into you.

30:13.400 --> 30:15.800
But you just keep thinking
about Prince Jing.

30:16.320 --> 30:17.720
Prince Jing is frivolous and unrestrained.

30:17.800 --> 30:20.440
How can he be worthy
of our Yin family's female general?

30:20.520 --> 30:21.880
Aunt.

30:21.960 --> 30:22.920
In all,

30:23.440 --> 30:25.880
the Crown Prince is the best choice.

30:26.520 --> 30:29.160
- On this Shangsi Festival, how about…?
- Aunt,

30:29.240 --> 30:31.520
the matters entrusted by His Majesty
have not been completed.

30:31.600 --> 30:32.640
It's really not appropriate to celebrate.

30:34.680 --> 30:36.600
Your Highness, the Crown Prince
requests an audience.

30:39.200 --> 30:40.120
Let him come in.

30:43.160 --> 30:45.000
Greetings, Your Highness.

30:46.080 --> 30:47.160
As you were.

30:48.240 --> 30:51.280
- General Yin.
- Greetings, Your Highness.

30:53.280 --> 30:54.840
Your Highness, you've come just in time.

30:55.680 --> 30:58.000
Just now, Luomei and I
were talking about you.

30:59.160 --> 31:00.200
She's just returned to the capital,

31:00.280 --> 31:02.840
and Your Highness sent her
many precious gifts.

31:02.920 --> 31:04.080
She likes them very much.

31:04.760 --> 31:05.600
As long as General Yin is satisfied.

31:06.200 --> 31:08.600
I like her return gifts very much.

31:13.520 --> 31:14.520
Speaking of which,

31:14.600 --> 31:16.360
you've been childhood sweethearts
since you were kids.

31:16.960 --> 31:19.000
Why do you seem distant now?

31:20.760 --> 31:21.720
I remember

31:22.400 --> 31:25.520
that Luomei loved all the excitement
and activity when she was little.

31:26.120 --> 31:27.720
One year on the Shangsi Festival,

31:27.800 --> 31:30.400
she took Your Highness
to see the fire dragon.

31:30.960 --> 31:31.840
Aunt,

31:31.920 --> 31:35.200
it was Prince Jing who took His Highness
to see the fire dragon.

31:38.360 --> 31:40.720
Although the Shangsi Festival
is a day to celebrate the spring,

31:41.360 --> 31:42.800
the custom of the fire dragon dance

31:42.880 --> 31:44.640
is a ritual passed down
from our ancestors to honor the gods.

31:45.240 --> 31:47.240
This year happens to mark the 35th year
of my father's reign.

31:47.320 --> 31:49.400
The fire dragon display
will be the most spectacular.

31:50.480 --> 31:52.280
General, you haven't been back
to the capital for a long time.

31:52.360 --> 31:54.320
Why don't you come with me

31:54.400 --> 31:56.960
to pray for the safety and blessings
of our Great Yan's 100,000 soldiers?

32:07.040 --> 32:10.720
EXEMPLARY CONDUCT AND VIRTUE

32:11.920 --> 32:13.360
Rest assured, Sir.

32:13.440 --> 32:14.560
No matter what,

32:14.640 --> 32:17.680
I will receive word from that person
after the Shangsi Festival.

32:24.040 --> 32:25.560
Come and take a look.

32:29.720 --> 32:31.320
Bravo!

32:31.400 --> 32:33.040
Bravo!

32:37.760 --> 32:39.080
Bravo!

32:45.000 --> 32:48.240
Your task today
is to celebrate the festival with me.

32:48.320 --> 32:50.680
Don't worry about anything else.

32:52.920 --> 32:54.360
Thank you for the medicine.

32:56.080 --> 32:57.000
Can you taste anything now?

33:00.360 --> 33:01.800
It doesn't matter.

33:01.880 --> 33:04.920
You said that vengeance
puts people at stake.

33:05.000 --> 33:08.120
Why should a dying girl
care about any flavors?

33:13.760 --> 33:17.360
Since you're dying,
every day you live is a bonus.

33:17.440 --> 33:19.440
You should live it fully and meaningfully.

33:20.720 --> 33:21.880
The flavors of life

33:22.640 --> 33:24.400
don't necessarily have to be tasted
with the tongue.

33:29.640 --> 33:30.880
Have you played this?

33:36.680 --> 33:38.360
Come on. I'll teach you.

33:42.880 --> 33:43.800
Excuse me.

33:47.680 --> 33:48.560
Sir.

33:56.440 --> 33:57.320
Watch carefully.

34:01.200 --> 34:03.760
Bravo! Bravo!

34:08.520 --> 34:10.000
Bravo!

34:10.080 --> 34:11.280
Take it.

34:12.199 --> 34:13.199
So accurate!

34:13.280 --> 34:15.719
He is truly exceptional in his skills.

34:17.080 --> 34:20.239
Our task is to divert attention

34:20.320 --> 34:21.560
and buy time.

34:25.679 --> 34:26.679
Bravo!

34:26.760 --> 34:28.600
Sir, give me some of these.

34:39.320 --> 34:42.199
Bravo!

34:46.280 --> 34:47.719
She'll miss it.

34:50.800 --> 34:53.639
Amazing!

34:55.760 --> 34:57.480
Sir, give me some more.

35:02.600 --> 35:04.520
Miss, we're running a small business.

35:04.600 --> 35:06.480
You can have the rest
of the sugar figures.

35:18.720 --> 35:21.240
I want one, too.

35:21.320 --> 35:22.480
- Okay.
- I want one, too.

35:22.560 --> 35:24.480
- Everyone can get one.
- I want one, too.

35:24.560 --> 35:25.600
Here.

35:26.320 --> 35:27.400
I want one, too.

35:27.480 --> 35:29.200
- Okay.
- Thank you, miss.

35:29.280 --> 35:30.160
Here.

35:30.240 --> 35:31.880
Thank you, miss.

35:32.480 --> 35:33.320
My lord.

35:33.400 --> 35:34.960
I'm not a--

35:37.360 --> 35:38.200
Is it sweet?

35:44.480 --> 35:45.760
It's sweet.

36:01.920 --> 36:04.640
FUFANG PAVILION

36:11.560 --> 36:15.160
FUFANG PAVILION

36:15.240 --> 36:17.280
Fufang Pavilion. Inform Prince Jing.

36:24.200 --> 36:25.680
Meiniang has entered Fufang Pavilion.

36:26.680 --> 36:28.800
What time is the fire dragon parade?

36:28.880 --> 36:29.840
At the hour of Xu.

36:33.080 --> 36:36.280
Silence Meiniang immediately
at the hour of Xu.

36:36.840 --> 36:37.680
Yes.

36:45.680 --> 36:47.320
FUFANG PAVILION

36:56.840 --> 36:57.720
Do you want a mask?

36:57.800 --> 36:58.720
Buy one for your child.

36:59.320 --> 37:01.720
Do you want a mask?
Look, there are all kinds of masks.

37:34.160 --> 37:35.760
Bravo!

37:35.840 --> 37:37.840
One more time! One more time!

37:39.800 --> 37:41.600
Bravo! Bravo!

37:44.280 --> 37:46.520
Bravo! Bravo!

37:46.600 --> 37:48.200
Amazing!

37:48.280 --> 37:49.680
One more time!

37:49.760 --> 37:51.560
Amazing!

37:52.920 --> 37:54.000
Bravo!

37:54.520 --> 37:55.800
This looks real.

37:55.880 --> 37:59.200
Bravo!

38:00.640 --> 38:01.720
Bravo!

38:02.880 --> 38:04.840
Bravo! Bravo!

38:06.880 --> 38:08.080
Let's go to Fufang Pavilion.

38:13.800 --> 38:15.240
This is the first time
we've explored Zhaojing together

38:15.320 --> 38:16.240
since we grew up.

38:17.440 --> 38:19.640
Didn't we watch the fire dragon together
when we were little?

38:23.080 --> 38:26.800
It took me 13 years
to be able to walk beside you today.

38:33.920 --> 38:35.720
Jinghe, what's there to see
about the fire dragon?

38:36.640 --> 38:37.880
You'll win a battle after watching it.

38:37.960 --> 38:39.320
Luomei, don't you want to fight?

38:39.960 --> 38:41.320
Let's go. The fire dragon dance
is about to begin.

38:41.400 --> 38:42.240
Go this way.

38:42.320 --> 38:43.960
Fufang Pavilion is the best spot
to watch the fire dragon.

38:44.040 --> 38:44.880
I've booked a private room.

38:45.680 --> 38:46.680
Follow us, Big Brother.

39:08.000 --> 39:09.760
Master, it's the Crown Prince
and Prince Jing.

39:09.840 --> 39:10.920
Should we stop the operation?

39:11.000 --> 39:11.840
Wait.

39:16.440 --> 39:17.440
Go down and see what's going on.

39:17.520 --> 39:18.600
Yes.

39:24.480 --> 39:26.520
Big Brother, Luomei,

39:26.600 --> 39:28.560
are you here to watch the fire dragon?

39:30.120 --> 39:31.120
Is this Miss Mei Lin?

39:32.080 --> 39:34.120
Third Brother, you're really lucky.

39:36.360 --> 39:37.600
Big Brother,

39:37.680 --> 39:40.200
I've ordered ten Beauties
at Zhixiang Tower.

39:40.280 --> 39:41.680
They're all charming.

39:41.760 --> 39:44.160
Will you have fun together with me?

39:44.240 --> 39:45.320
Murong Jinghe.

39:49.680 --> 39:51.400
You've scared my Beauty, General Yin.

39:52.480 --> 39:53.600
Mei,

39:54.120 --> 39:55.400
General Yin

39:55.480 --> 39:57.800
is the No. 1 female general in Great Yan.

39:57.880 --> 39:59.840
Don't try to offend her.

39:59.920 --> 40:01.920
Third Brother, stop fooling around.

40:02.000 --> 40:03.200
Today, Luomei and I

40:03.280 --> 40:05.320
have come to pray
for the soldiers of Great Yan.

40:06.760 --> 40:09.360
Your Highness, Prince Jing is having fun
with the Beauty.

40:09.440 --> 40:10.280
Let's not disturb him.

40:15.920 --> 40:17.840
FUFANG PAVILION

40:27.280 --> 40:28.840
There is a sulfur smell on this man.

40:35.880 --> 40:38.520
QINGYIN PAVILION

40:54.040 --> 40:55.640
They should be making
the transaction in the next room.

40:56.400 --> 40:58.120
Everyone is waiting for the fire dragon.

40:58.200 --> 41:00.360
Only that window across remains shut.

41:00.960 --> 41:02.320
Miss Mei Lin, you're observant.

41:02.400 --> 41:04.000
I also suspect there's an ambush
across from us.

41:04.080 --> 41:05.800
Just now, I saw the middleman
from the black market.

41:05.880 --> 41:08.200
I heard there'd be an illegal iron trade
transaction at Qingyin Pavilion tonight.

41:21.760 --> 41:22.960
Zhang Yin wants to silence Meiniang.

41:23.560 --> 41:24.520
He is very likely to be in the room
across from us.

41:24.600 --> 41:26.080
Let's go over now.

41:26.160 --> 41:27.400
You stay here and keep
a close eye on Meiniang.

41:27.480 --> 41:28.360
Okay.

41:32.480 --> 41:33.320
Be careful.

41:38.520 --> 41:40.400
Miss, come and buy a kite.

41:40.480 --> 41:41.480
Let me take a look.

41:41.560 --> 41:42.880
Pick any one you want.

41:42.960 --> 41:45.120
Father, when will the fire dragon come?

41:45.800 --> 41:47.560
Soon. Follow me.

42:23.600 --> 42:25.560
Why is Mr. Yue Qin here?
